Beijing time Jan.31 version update log:

• Shorten the cart route in Homeland Defense Mode, the end point of the cart will be far away from the Boss refresh point, and correct the problem that some end points exceed the boundary;
• Normal missions drop weapon plug-in unlocking materials;
• Normal mode now drops more money;
• Increased effectiveness range of core weapon the Warhammer of Truth;
• The passive skill Sacrifice has been greatly enhanced;
• Fixed an issue where the cart Mission Carrier would be hit by the player's drone;
• Fixed the problem that the fourth level of the normal mode could not be entered;
• Fixed the problem that spawning mobs stopped in tower defense task;
• Fixed the problem that SU-100 could get the second sprint without unlocking it;
• Try to fix the problem that the close-up shots of killing the Boss in the homeland defense mode cannot return to the original position;
• Removal the mechanism where casting core weapons would inevitably cause downtime;
• Other BUG fixes;
• Other performance optimizations;
• Other balance adjustments;
